      "content": "Your feelings of not being useful are incredibly painful, though your worth as a human being never depends on your career or any external title. Please be patient with yourself; identity is like a muscle that sheds old layers and rebuilds in time, and your current challenge is real but does not define your future. I am here to listen whenever you need to talk about the weight you're carrying.",
